(3355042, 466769, 66223, '<td valign="top">this is great!  perfect color matching... and, best use i''ve ever seen for brussel sprouts (do they have any other use? :-)</td>', 'this is great!  perfect color matching... and, best use i''ve ever seen for brussel sprouts (do they have any other use? :-)', '2007-02-12 00:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
