(3355127, 467406, 66515, '<td valign="top">A little on the small side. Use the full allowed size for your submission.<br/> <br/>That aside the angle you chose to shoot at is a little "blah". The colors are great however. I better angle that makes me go "hmm..I want to eat that" would definitely sell me on this.</td>', 'A little on the small side. Use the full allowed size for your submission. That aside the angle you chose to shoot at is a little "blah". The colors are great however. I better angle that makes me go "hmm..I want to eat that" would definitely sell me on this.', '2007-02-12 00:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
