(3355144, 467456, 59415, '<td valign="top">It reminds me of Sesame Street.  I stare at this and wait for the fruit to begin moving around and counting.</td>', 'It reminds me of Sesame Street.  I stare at this and wait for the fruit to begin moving around and counting.', '2007-02-12 00:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3355145, 466724, 47316, '<td valign="top">This is a really fun concept!<br/> <br/>To me though I''d have gone with a much less distracting background, there is already a lot going on. The hand positions  seems a little odd to me too... seems like the "magician" should look more in control of the fruits and veggies instead of suprised that they are floating.</td>', 'This is a really fun concept! To me though I''d have gone with a much less distracting background, there is already a lot going on. The hand positions  seems a little odd to me too... seems like the "magician" should look more in control of the fruits and veggies instead of suprised that they are floating.', '2007-02-12 00:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3355146, 467370, 15711, '<td valign="top">Makes me think of Rembrandt''s "Man in the Golden Helmet" - with that glowing painterly feel.  Quite lovely.  The centering of the subject works beautifully.</td>', 'Makes me think of Rembrandt''s "Man in the Golden Helmet" - with that glowing painterly feel.  Quite lovely.  The centering of the subject works beautifully.', '2007-02-12 00:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
