(3356319, 467447, 43463, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the creativity in this one!! This one really stands out from the pack. Adorned in nothing but vegetables and sprouting ''yellow/orange'' horns on her head she appears as a nature spirit - either a female version of Pan or a Nature nymph whose realm lies in the planting and harvesting of vegetables. Lighting is spot on with hightlights &amp; shadows perfect. The light green background a very subtle nod to the greens of nature - had it been a white or black background it would not have complimented the photo composition so well. The warm glow surrounding your nature nymph is also a perfect compliment because not only does it illuminate her in a soft glow but the glow helps invoke the idea the she is a magical creature. Wonderful job bumping you up to a 9.</td>', 'I LOVE the creativity in this one!! This one really stands out from the pack. Adorned in nothing but vegetables and sprouting ''yellow/orange'' horns on her head she appears as a nature spirit - either a female version of Pan or a Nature nymph whose realm lies in the planting and harvesting of vegetables. Lighting is spot on with hightlights & shadows perfect. The light green background a very subtle nod to the greens of nature - had it been a white or black background it would not have complimented the photo composition so well. The warm glow surrounding your nature nymph is also a perfect compliment because not only does it illuminate her in a soft glow but the glow helps invoke the idea the she is a magical creature. Wonderful job bumping you up to a 9.', '2007-02-12 08:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
