(3356339, 467061, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the red and yellow tones of the two apples in the forefront. The green leaf laying across the apple in the foreground is a nice touch. The greens of nature really are a wonderful backdrop for this apple still life. The Lighting and focus is spot on fabulous. I see so many lovely details from the stem of the apple to the drops of water adorning the apples. It is the colors and the beads of moisture on the the apples that make this a very appealing image to taste - literally, it does make one''s mouth water just looking at this lovely presented apple.</td>', 'Love the red and yellow tones of the two apples in the forefront. The green leaf laying across the apple in the foreground is a nice touch. The greens of nature really are a wonderful backdrop for this apple still life. The Lighting and focus is spot on fabulous. I see so many lovely details from the stem of the apple to the drops of water adorning the apples. It is the colors and the beads of moisture on the the apples that make this a very appealing image to taste - literally, it does make one''s mouth water just looking at this lovely presented apple.', '2007-02-12 08:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
