(3356457, 466908, 36328, '<td valign="top">IMHO there is just far too much noise and too many blown highlights in this one. <br/> <br/>Agin IMHO it doesn''t appear that there has been any consideration for the composition of this, with the edges of the plate out of frame and the distracing background to the left and top of the frame.<br/> <br/>Sorry to be mean (3)</td>', 'IMHO there is just far too much noise and too many blown highlights in this one.  Agin IMHO it doesn''t appear that there has been any consideration for the composition of this, with the edges of the plate out of frame and the distracing background to the left and top of the frame. Sorry to be mean (3)', '2007-02-12 09:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3356458, 466959, 15711, '<td valign="top">Is that a banana in your pocket, or are you just happy to see me? (sorry, that''s the first thing that came to mind).  Different and I like the curve of the fruit almost mimicking the arched "v" of the jean pocket. Blue/yellow - great complementary colors. Probably one of the better entries of the challenge.</td>', 'Is that a banana in your pocket, or are you just happy to see me? (sorry, that''s the first thing that came to mind).  Different and I like the curve of the fruit almost mimicking the arched "v" of the jean pocket. Blue/yellow - great complementary colors. Probably one of the better entries of the challenge.', '2007-02-12 09:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3356461, 467115, 15711, '<td valign="top">Pretty. I like the green/purple theme.  Nice diatonal line. That stalk to the right is a tad distracting. If it were mine, I''d up the saturation of color a tad.</td>', 'Pretty. I like the green/purple theme.  Nice diatonal line. That stalk to the right is a tad distracting. If it were mine, I''d up the saturation of color a tad.', '2007-02-12 09:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
