(3356469, 467373, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the way you approached the coloration. Maybe not so centered.  I think I''d have it lying on the diagonal.  Maybe not. ;~D</td>', 'I like the way you approached the coloration. Maybe not so centered.  I think I''d have it lying on the diagonal.  Maybe not. ;~D', '2007-02-12 09:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
