(3356502, 466266, 36328, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of how the blown hightlight in the top left blends 100% (on my monitor) into the border of the this shot - becasue of this the whole foreground of the shot seems to be under-expoused. <br/> <br/>Compositionly sound, but I would like to have seen more punch in the colours - especially in the grapefruit. One last nit-pick, IMHO the border does nothing for this shot, the top and bottom approach should have been swap for a full wrap around at about half the width. <br/> <br/>Sorry to be so mean (4)</td>', 'I''m not a fan of how the blown hightlight in the top left blends 100% (on my monitor) into the border of the this shot - becasue of this the whole foreground of the shot seems to be under-expoused.  Compositionly sound, but I would like to have seen more punch in the colours - especially in the grapefruit. One last nit-pick, IMHO the border does nothing for this shot, the top and bottom approach should have been swap for a full wrap around at about half the width.  Sorry to be so mean (4)', '2007-02-12 09:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
