(3357003, 466870, 36328, '<td valign="top">If this fly is real (and I''ll assume it is), then great capture - and in fact I can let it go that I think it''s not quite sharp enough. <br/> <br/>If the fly is fake, and this is composed, more care should have been taken to get the right area for maximum sharpeness. <br/> <br/>The colours are slightly too muted for my taste, but that''s ok, as the green on the fly pops out nicely. <br/> <br/>Well done (6)</td>', 'If this fly is real (and I''ll assume it is), then great capture - and in fact I can let it go that I think it''s not quite sharp enough.  If the fly is fake, and this is composed, more care should have been taken to get the right area for maximum sharpeness.  The colours are slightly too muted for my taste, but that''s ok, as the green on the fly pops out nicely.  Well done (6)', '2007-02-12 11:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
