(3357364, 467042, 43463, '<td valign="top">Clever set-up and very good execution. Love the backlighting that gives the main objects a soft glow. Lighting is spot on illuminating all subjects very well so that we can ''drink'' in the details of this image - no distracting reflections or glare on the glass even!</td>', 'Clever set-up and very good execution. Love the backlighting that gives the main objects a soft glow. Lighting is spot on illuminating all subjects very well so that we can ''drink'' in the details of this image - no distracting reflections or glare on the glass even!', '2007-02-12 12:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
