(3357391, 467164, 34113, '<td valign="top">Clever, bright and saturated.</td>', 'Clever, bright and saturated.', '2007-02-12 12:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3357393, 467180, 34113, '<td valign="top">Clever and philosophic.</td>', 'Clever and philosophic.', '2007-02-12 12:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3357397, 467388, 43463, '<td valign="top">Love the warm tones of the oranges and yellows in this one. Illuminating the sliced portions of the fruit such that the light shines through not only gives us a view of all the lovely details of the fruit BUT it also gives us a warm sunshiny feeling.</td>', 'Love the warm tones of the oranges and yellows in this one. Illuminating the sliced portions of the fruit such that the light shines through not only gives us a view of all the lovely details of the fruit BUT it also gives us a warm sunshiny feeling.', '2007-02-12 12:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3357401, 467381, 54843, '<td valign="top">Very neat concept.  A couple of improvements:  The streaks on hte guy''s face give it away that he is laying down.  Getting rid of those streaks is easy.  I can also see the strings around the orange and somewhat aroung the bannana.  Getting rid of that is easy in PS as well...it is also legal for advanced editing. 8</td>', 'Very neat concept.  A couple of improvements:  The streaks on hte guy''s face give it away that he is laying down.  Getting rid of those streaks is easy.  I can also see the strings around the orange and somewhat aroung the bannana.  Getting rid of that is easy in PS as well...it is also legal for advanced editing. 8', '2007-02-12 12:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
