(3357920, 465801, 66348, '<td valign="top">Love the angle of your shot, and the variety of fruits and vegetables. I also love the different kinds of fruit, they are not your everyday supermarket fruits. The colors are incredible, and the composition is excellant. Well done.</td>', 'Love the angle of your shot, and the variety of fruits and vegetables. I also love the different kinds of fruit, they are not your everyday supermarket fruits. The colors are incredible, and the composition is excellant. Well done.', '2007-02-12 15:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
