(3357942, 465786, 43774, '<td valign="top">I can see where you erased/darkened the background, there are huge areas you missed around the peppers.</td>', 'I can see where you erased/darkened the background, there are huge areas you missed around the peppers.', '2007-02-12 15:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3357952, 465801, 52992, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.', '2007-02-12 15:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3357956, 467447, 66348, '<td valign="top">Escapetooz?? Of course it is. I really love your work, you always have great ideas, and this shot is no different. I really like your setup and idea, your expression is priceless, great use of vegetables, and you have incredibly beautiful lips I might add. Only thing IMO is the lighting seems a bit off, it might just be due to the window lighting, but it seems as if the left side of your stomach almost seems blown a bit. Other than that its a great piece of work. Nice job. 8</td>', 'Escapetooz?? Of course it is. I really love your work, you always have great ideas, and this shot is no different. I really like your setup and idea, your expression is priceless, great use of vegetables, and you have incredibly beautiful lips I might add. Only thing IMO is the lighting seems a bit off, it might just be due to the window lighting, but it seems as if the left side of your stomach almost seems blown a bit. Other than that its a great piece of work. Nice job. 8', '2007-02-12 15:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3357957, 466878, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great idea and setup. Love the idea, clarity, sharpness and lighting. Well done.</td>', 'Great idea and setup. Love the idea, clarity, sharpness and lighting. Well done.', '2007-02-12 15:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3357965, 465414, 30049, '<td valign="top">Love apples. I''d like them better in color I think.  Oh, sorry, I was just answering your title questions.  I don''t know, something about this just doesn''t feel right.  The desat isn''t adding anything IMO.  The composition also feels awkward, like there''s too much space and the red apple needs to be more off-center.  You did do a nice job in using selection tools to isolate the single red apple as the editing is not noticeable.  All of the above is JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Love apples. I''d like them better in color I think.  Oh, sorry, I was just answering your title questions.  I don''t know, something about this just doesn''t feel right.  The desat isn''t adding anything IMO.  The composition also feels awkward, like there''s too much space and the red apple needs to be more off-center.  You did do a nice job in using selection tools to isolate the single red apple as the editing is not noticeable.  All of the above is JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-02-12 15:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3357966, 465897, 66348, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful. Love the clarity and sharpness. Its an incredible shot. The colors are beautiful and your composition is right on. Well done. 9</td>', 'Just beautiful. Love the clarity and sharpness. Its an incredible shot. The colors are beautiful and your composition is right on. Well done. 9', '2007-02-12 15:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3357971, 467380, 66348, '<td valign="top">Really great setup. Love the color mixed in with the B&amp;W. Very nice idea and nicely composed.</td>', 'Really great setup. Love the color mixed in with the B&W. Very nice idea and nicely composed.', '2007-02-12 15:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3357974, 466386, 66348, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed, setup and shot. Great lighting. Love the sharpness and colors in your choice of vegetables. Nice work.</td>', 'Very nicely composed, setup and shot. Great lighting. Love the sharpness and colors in your choice of vegetables. Nice work.', '2007-02-12 15:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3357976, 466917, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice still life...well, mostly.  The lighting, exposure, and focus are all right on (great DOF!).  However, something weird going on on the left side background as I''m seeing some light and dark patches.  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice still life...well, mostly.  The lighting, exposure, and focus are all right on (great DOF!).  However, something weird going on on the left side background as I''m seeing some light and dark patches.  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.', '2007-02-12 16:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
