(3358213, 467202, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot - the composition, with the alien landscape in the foreground and the out-of-focus alien tree-like growth behind (I have a fertile imagination) balances well. Such interesting shapes and textures.</td>', 'I like this a lot - the composition, with the alien landscape in the foreground and the out-of-focus alien tree-like growth behind (I have a fertile imagination) balances well. Such interesting shapes and textures.', '2007-02-12 17:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3358216, 467390, 72714, '<td valign="top">A lovely, well lit shot although you almost have two separate photographs IMO, For example, you could literally take a pair of scissors and cut through the middle and still have a lovely photo of apples and a gorgeous photo of a baby. Technically perfect though.</td>', 'A lovely, well lit shot although you almost have two separate photographs IMO, For example, you could literally take a pair of scissors and cut through the middle and still have a lovely photo of apples and a gorgeous photo of a baby. Technically perfect though.', '2007-02-12 17:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3358222, 466806, 72714, '<td valign="top">I like the angle you''ve used and the open space you''ve left on the right. This could have fitted in the minimalism challenge as well. Well photographed.</td>', 'I like the angle you''ve used and the open space you''ve left on the right. This could have fitted in the minimalism challenge as well. Well photographed.', '2007-02-12 17:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3358224, 466264, 3087, '<td valign="top">Colour balance seems slightly too blue to me but overall, I really like the palette of greens. Love the mix of heavy, solid shapes and slim, curving tendrils. Not sure overall composition works for me - my eye isn''t easily led around the frame and tends to settle straight on the central, spherical object.</td>', 'Colour balance seems slightly too blue to me but overall, I really like the palette of greens. Love the mix of heavy, solid shapes and slim, curving tendrils. Not sure overall composition works for me - my eye isn''t easily led around the frame and tends to settle straight on the central, spherical object.', '2007-02-12 17:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3358229, 466852, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cute idea and nicely captured!</td>', 'Cute idea and nicely captured!', '2007-02-12 17:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3358231, 467133, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice study of the kind of beautiful detail we often overlook. Colours and repetitive shapes work well.</td>', 'Nice study of the kind of beautiful detail we often overlook. Colours and repetitive shapes work well.', '2007-02-12 17:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3358233, 465568, 72714, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! I love it! Dramatic, very different, well lit....what more can I say?</td>', 'Fantastic! I love it! Dramatic, very different, well lit....what more can I say?', '2007-02-12 17:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3358237, 465786, 73230, '<td valign="top">Looks like you either need to adjust your montior settings or are trying to be creative. I can see distinct cutout lines around the peppers and not even precise ones.</td>', 'Looks like you either need to adjust your montior settings or are trying to be creative. I can see distinct cutout lines around the peppers and not even precise ones.', '2007-02-12 17:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3358239, 467061, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely vibrant colours and great contrast between those rich reds and yellows and the greens both infront and behind. The composition is a little different and I find it more interesting as a result - particularly like your inclusion of leaves infront of and between the apples as well as green foliage behind. I could reach out and grab one!</td>', 'Lovely vibrant colours and great contrast between those rich reds and yellows and the greens both infront and behind. The composition is a little different and I find it more interesting as a result - particularly like your inclusion of leaves infront of and between the apples as well as green foliage behind. I could reach out and grab one!', '2007-02-12 17:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3358241, 466400, 3087, '<td valign="top">Filling the frame like this works well and I like your odd-one-out presentation.</td>', 'Filling the frame like this works well and I like your odd-one-out presentation.', '2007-02-12 17:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
