(3359699, 464308, 811, '<td valign="top">interesting idea, but it looks like it may have been seriously underexposed and adjusted in post processing, which introduced a lot of noise.<br/> <br/>Compositionally, it is a bit "busy."  there is a lot going on here, and the perspective is a bit to "straight on."  One thing that might make it a bit more dynamic is to lower your perspective and use a shallow depth of field to highlight the fruit/veggies from the pieces.  Or simplify, and try not to include quite so much "stuff" in the picture.</td>', 'interesting idea, but it looks like it may have been seriously underexposed and adjusted in post processing, which introduced a lot of noise. Compositionally, it is a bit "busy."  there is a lot going on here, and the perspective is a bit to "straight on."  One thing that might make it a bit more dynamic is to lower your perspective and use a shallow depth of field to highlight the fruit/veggies from the pieces.  Or simplify, and try not to include quite so much "stuff" in the picture.', '2007-02-13 00:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3359703, 467168, 811, '<td valign="top">cool idea.  i think a different color flower, or a different fruit would have worked better though.  as it is, there is a lot of yellow tones and that gives the shot a uniform feeling.  different colors could help each stand out more</td>', 'cool idea.  i think a different color flower, or a different fruit would have worked better though.  as it is, there is a lot of yellow tones and that gives the shot a uniform feeling.  different colors could help each stand out more', '2007-02-13 00:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
