(3360080, 466932, 56400, '<td valign="top">Lighting is very harsh. Have you tried holding some toilet tissue or a handkerchief over your flash? Either one gives a nice diffusion and softening to the light.</td>', 'Lighting is very harsh. Have you tried holding some toilet tissue or a handkerchief over your flash? Either one gives a nice diffusion and softening to the light.', '2007-02-13 04:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3360089, 467397, 56400, '<td valign="top">''Atlas Shrugged'' might also have made for a good title for this one. Good shot overall.</td>', '''Atlas Shrugged'' might also have made for a good title for this one. Good shot overall.', '2007-02-13 04:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3360090, 466568, 36328, '<td valign="top">You definately achieve what I think you set out to do. I like the shafts of light that fall onto the fruit. <br/> <br/>I think that a different colour material (deep, dark red) would have worked better for placing the basket on - I reckon it would add more devine (or even Roman?) feel to it. <br/> <br/>Also, there is a quite a lot of noise in the background. A change to the foreground colour would have allowed you to push the black background deep to the black. <br/> <br/>Nice shot (5)</td>', 'You definately achieve what I think you set out to do. I like the shafts of light that fall onto the fruit.  I think that a different colour material (deep, dark red) would have worked better for placing the basket on - I reckon it would add more devine (or even Roman?) feel to it.  Also, there is a quite a lot of noise in the background. A change to the foreground colour would have allowed you to push the black background deep to the black.  Nice shot (5)', '2007-02-13 04:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3360096, 467379, 36328, '<td valign="top">One of many variations on an overdone theme for this challenge (sorry, that sounds mean!)<br/> <br/>Unfortunatly, this isn''t the best one either. The light seems a little harsh in places and very flat as you move to the edges of the frame. There also seems to be a lot of noise in the apple. <br/> <br/>Good attempt all the same (4) (I would give 4.5 if I could)</td>', 'One of many variations on an overdone theme for this challenge (sorry, that sounds mean!) Unfortunatly, this isn''t the best one either. The light seems a little harsh in places and very flat as you move to the edges of the frame. There also seems to be a lot of noise in the apple.  Good attempt all the same (4) (I would give 4.5 if I could)', '2007-02-13 04:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3360099, 467386, 36328, '<td valign="top">Nice, using the old fruit helps to tell a story. In my mind this represent to old freinds leaning on eachother in the twilight of their days. <br/> <br/>Compositional strong - although there is some noise and it''s not as sharp as it could be. <br/> <br/>Nice overall tones and I love the reflection (6)</td>', 'Nice, using the old fruit helps to tell a story. In my mind this represent to old freinds leaning on eachother in the twilight of their days.  Compositional strong - although there is some noise and it''s not as sharp as it could be.  Nice overall tones and I love the reflection (6)', '2007-02-13 04:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3360103, 466803, 56400, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, that''s an interesting looking fruit. I don''t think this is native to North America. Looks like it might be related to the Kiwi fruit.<br/>Photographically, it could use a bit of fill light from the right to show off the textures on the cut ends. Otherwise good shot.</td>', 'Hmmm, that''s an interesting looking fruit. I don''t think this is native to North America. Looks like it might be related to the Kiwi fruit.Photographically, it could use a bit of fill light from the right to show off the textures on the cut ends. Otherwise good shot.', '2007-02-13 05:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3360111, 467266, 54778, '<td valign="top">nice use of minimalism and b/w</td>', 'nice use of minimalism and b/w', '2007-02-13 05:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
