(3360123, 467454, 36328, '<td valign="top">This is a great subject that (of course) fits the challenge.<br/> <br/>The lighting is great and the dropplets just add that extra interest for the eye. However, I''m not 100% sold on the composition - there are also one or two blown highlights on the top of the pepper. <br/> <br/>Nice shot, shame about the composition (maybe go back and re-crop?) (5)</td>', 'This is a great subject that (of course) fits the challenge. The lighting is great and the dropplets just add that extra interest for the eye. However, I''m not 100% sold on the composition - there are also one or two blown highlights on the top of the pepper.  Nice shot, shame about the composition (maybe go back and re-crop?) (5)', '2007-02-13 05:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3360125, 466852, 36328, '<td valign="top">Great study of shape, colour and lighting, although there are one or two slight hotspots.<br/> <br/>Other than that, I love it. (7)</td>', 'Great study of shape, colour and lighting, although there are one or two slight hotspots. Other than that, I love it. (7)', '2007-02-13 05:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3360129, 467366, 36328, '<td valign="top">One of many variations on an overdone theme for this challenge (sorry, that sounds mean!)<br/> <br/>This one however had been very well excuted. The colours are good, but there are one or two hotspots. I also think it''s cropped a little too tight. <br/> <br/>All that said, it''s a good image (5)</td>', 'One of many variations on an overdone theme for this challenge (sorry, that sounds mean!) This one however had been very well excuted. The colours are good, but there are one or two hotspots. I also think it''s cropped a little too tight.  All that said, it''s a good image (5)', '2007-02-13 05:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3360142, 466785, 36328, '<td valign="top">I like this, as it tells my mind a story - I''m given a context and setting by this shot. It''s not just a shot of a fruit or veg thrown into a fich tank or a glass - you''re washing the fresh mushrooms - getting them ready for a dish or a salad or to just eat. <br/> <br/>The colours are well represent, not too over done or understate, and the exposure is spot on. The focus is in all the right places and I like the creative use of DoF. <br/> <br/>Good luck with one (7)</td>', 'I like this, as it tells my mind a story - I''m given a context and setting by this shot. It''s not just a shot of a fruit or veg thrown into a fich tank or a glass - you''re washing the fresh mushrooms - getting them ready for a dish or a salad or to just eat.  The colours are well represent, not too over done or understate, and the exposure is spot on. The focus is in all the right places and I like the creative use of DoF.  Good luck with one (7)', '2007-02-13 05:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
