(3360513, 467368, 36328, '<td valign="top">The title is really what make this one stick together - without it, I would struggle to understand the significence of these two objects.<br/> <br/>Compositionaly, it''s spot on. Clean and well postitioned. <br/> <br/>It is a little soft, and lacks the extra punch of a saturation boost. <br/> <br/>All in all, a pleasing shot (5)</td>', 'The title is really what make this one stick together - without it, I would struggle to understand the significence of these two objects. Compositionaly, it''s spot on. Clean and well postitioned.  It is a little soft, and lacks the extra punch of a saturation boost.  All in all, a pleasing shot (5)', '2007-02-13 09:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
