(3360672, 467271, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice complementary colors.  Good focus and details.  Lighting may be a tad harsh (diffusing it some might help - unless this is the look you wanted).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice complementary colors.  Good focus and details.  Lighting may be a tad harsh (diffusing it some might help - unless this is the look you wanted).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-02-13 10:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
