(3360757, 467111, 30049, '<td valign="top">Aren''t these mushrooms?  Interesting photo and fun to look at, but I imagine you''ll get hammered on the connection to the challenge.  I just looked them (mushrooms) up and technically I guess they qualify as they are considered the "fruiting body".  Hmmm...learn something new everyday.  :D  Good luck in the challenge (you''re going to need it).  :P</td>', 'Aren''t these mushrooms?  Interesting photo and fun to look at, but I imagine you''ll get hammered on the connection to the challenge.  I just looked them (mushrooms) up and technically I guess they qualify as they are considered the "fruiting body".  Hmmm...learn something new everyday.  :D  Good luck in the challenge (you''re going to need it).  :P', '2007-02-13 10:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3360774, 466685, 36382, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like the sharpness and the idea.  The colors are nice together.  The hint of reflection is just right.  It might be a tad dark or that may just be my monitor.  Overall it''s very good.</td>', 'Nice.  I like the sharpness and the idea.  The colors are nice together.  The hint of reflection is just right.  It might be a tad dark or that may just be my monitor.  Overall it''s very good.', '2007-02-13 11:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
