(3360778, 467447, 64795, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and colors!</td>', 'Great lighting and colors!', '2007-02-13 11:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3360779, 466490, 36382, '<td valign="top">Good exposure on the garlic.  Nice.</td>', 'Good exposure on the garlic.  Nice.', '2007-02-13 11:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3360789, 467009, 64795, '<td valign="top">great lighting and composition!</td>', 'great lighting and composition!', '2007-02-13 11:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3360793, 467373, 36382, '<td valign="top">I like where this is going.  Maybe you could make more of a vignette around the celery, play around with the tones and think more about whether more could be made of the shadow.  It''s a cool idea and it''s 99 percent there, there is just something I can''t put my finger on which otherwise would make this image a perfect fine art print.  Seems like I''m criticising but I''m not I really like this a lot.  I''m just holding you to a very high standard because you are so close to making the perfect picture in my eyes.</td>', 'I like where this is going.  Maybe you could make more of a vignette around the celery, play around with the tones and think more about whether more could be made of the shadow.  It''s a cool idea and it''s 99 percent there, there is just something I can''t put my finger on which otherwise would make this image a perfect fine art print.  Seems like I''m criticising but I''m not I really like this a lot.  I''m just holding you to a very high standard because you are so close to making the perfect picture in my eyes.', '2007-02-13 11:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
