(3364814, 466785, 67809, '<td valign="top">Yum!  These mushrooms are making me hungry!  Nice use of shallow DOF and stop-motion too.</td>', 'Yum!  These mushrooms are making me hungry!  Nice use of shallow DOF and stop-motion too.', '2007-02-14 09:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364818, 467435, 43463, '<td valign="top">A very good close-up of a granny smith apple. A simple and clean minimalistic approach. Detail and lighting are very good. My critique is that the colors could do with a tad saturation boost. The green and blue tones appear a little flat and dull. Upping the saturation a tad should make the green of the apple really pop visually with the blue background.</td>', 'A very good close-up of a granny smith apple. A simple and clean minimalistic approach. Detail and lighting are very good. My critique is that the colors could do with a tad saturation boost. The green and blue tones appear a little flat and dull. Upping the saturation a tad should make the green of the apple really pop visually with the blue background.', '2007-02-14 09:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3364819, 466997, 67809, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting -- did you use a snoot or a grid to keep the lighting pattern so tight?</td>', 'Nice lighting -- did you use a snoot or a grid to keep the lighting pattern so tight?', '2007-02-14 09:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
