(3367991, 466878, 66524, '<td valign="top">Clever, but I would think the focus would be on the lemon, but I am too new to know about these technicalities of camera settiings.  Still the arrangement was done well, but the lighting to the left of the lemon, between the 2 broccoli stems seems more of a focus to my eye.  I look at the lemon center, then that area - never the photo as a whole.  Still a very nice photo...8</td>', 'Clever, but I would think the focus would be on the lemon, but I am too new to know about these technicalities of camera settiings.  Still the arrangement was done well, but the lighting to the left of the lemon, between the 2 broccoli stems seems more of a focus to my eye.  I look at the lemon center, then that area - never the photo as a whole.  Still a very nice photo...8', '2007-02-14 23:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
