(3368459, 466386, 68586, '<td valign="top">nicely lit, nice range of colours and textures. Good use of a frame to contain the picture. For me it would have been nice to hace a focal point in the picture, without one the eye sort of wanders about. The peppers are nice and bold but neither is fully in the frame, the mushrooms draw the eye as they are so white, but they spill out the frame, there is something creeping in below the onions but I''m not sure what it is . . It might just be me but I think a cetral point of focus would have made the picture stronger. You still get a vote though   :- )</td>', 'nicely lit, nice range of colours and textures. Good use of a frame to contain the picture. For me it would have been nice to hace a focal point in the picture, without one the eye sort of wanders about. The peppers are nice and bold but neither is fully in the frame, the mushrooms draw the eye as they are so white, but they spill out the frame, there is something creeping in below the onions but I''m not sure what it is . . It might just be me but I think a cetral point of focus would have made the picture stronger. You still get a vote though   :- )', '2007-02-15 06:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
