(3368814, 467191, 68586, '<td valign="top">Ayeee the splashy water thing again . .  lol.<br/> <br/>You''ve actually captured the shot very nicely (perhaps the Kiwi could have been a tad greener), but there seems to be a lot of splashing water in this comp. Still nice, still gets a vote.</td>', 'Ayeee the splashy water thing again . .  lol. You''ve actually captured the shot very nicely (perhaps the Kiwi could have been a tad greener), but there seems to be a lot of splashing water in this comp. Still nice, still gets a vote.', '2007-02-15 09:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368824, 466922, 68586, '<td valign="top">If the monkey had been sitting up holding this looking at the camera it would have been a much stronger shot - sadly wild animals rarely co-operate  :- )</td>', 'If the monkey had been sitting up holding this looking at the camera it would have been a much stronger shot - sadly wild animals rarely co-operate  :- )', '2007-02-15 09:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368839, 467382, 68586, '<td valign="top">Despite my best efforts I''m really not convinced that Fruit &amp; Veg look good in B&amp;W - but that''s obviously a personal viewpoint. Perhaps if you want to go B&amp;W with F&amp;V you ned to look for items that have a real texture and grain that can be brought out by the mono approach. Still get''s a vote though.</td>', 'Despite my best efforts I''m really not convinced that Fruit & Veg look good in B&W - but that''s obviously a personal viewpoint. Perhaps if you want to go B&W with F&V you ned to look for items that have a real texture and grain that can be brought out by the mono approach. Still get''s a vote though.', '2007-02-15 09:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368842, 467388, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and lighting. I wonder whether the top of the central slice should have been included ?</td>', 'Nice colours and lighting. I wonder whether the top of the central slice should have been included ?', '2007-02-15 09:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368855, 466774, 68586, '<td valign="top">I do like this. Personally I wonder whether it should have had all the pineapple with some foliage <b>or</b> all the foliage with some pineapple included? As it is we have some of both.<br/> <br/>You have certainly caught both the texture and lighting just right.</td>', 'I do like this. Personally I wonder whether it should have had all the pineapple with some foliage or all the foliage with some pineapple included? As it is we have some of both. You have certainly caught both the texture and lighting just right.', '2007-02-15 09:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3368862, 467364, 68586, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea, but a little ''messy'' for my personal tastes.<br/>It might have been interesting to try each layer of the pyramind as just one type of fruit, or each layer was many types of fruit but just one colour ?</td>', 'An interesting idea, but a little ''messy'' for my personal tastes.It might have been interesting to try each layer of the pyramind as just one type of fruit, or each layer was many types of fruit but just one colour ?', '2007-02-15 09:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
