(3369151, 467401, 59029, '<td valign="top">yummy - 7</td>', 'yummy - 7', '2007-02-15 11:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3369155, 465786, 29797, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and colors on the peppers. One thing I notice though, there''s quite a bit of lighter area around the peppers though compared to the rest of the black background. There''s a couple ways that would take care of this. My favorite way (since this is advanced editing) would be to use the quick mask tool and mask out the peppers (paint over the peppers with a hard-edged brush in the quick mask tool), then slide the brightness down a bit. Do that and you have a nice shot there.</td>', 'Nice lighting and colors on the peppers. One thing I notice though, there''s quite a bit of lighter area around the peppers though compared to the rest of the black background. There''s a couple ways that would take care of this. My favorite way (since this is advanced editing) would be to use the quick mask tool and mask out the peppers (paint over the peppers with a hard-edged brush in the quick mask tool), then slide the brightness down a bit. Do that and you have a nice shot there.', '2007-02-15 11:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
