(3371366, 466016, 67841, '<td valign="top">Oh man, my alternate for this challenge was turnips.  I REALLY wanted to try to take an otherwise unattractive fruit/vegetable &amp; do something interesting with it but went with a cliché shot instead (sort of a ''learn the rules before you break them'' lesson for me...).<br/> <br/>Anyway, that''s what I like about this - that and its strong first impression.  It''s a little bottom-heavy for my tastes and deeper dof would have satisfied my detail fix but I like the lighting you employed here.<br/> <br/>&lt;&lt; 9 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'Oh man, my alternate for this challenge was turnips.  I REALLY wanted to try to take an otherwise unattractive fruit/vegetable & do something interesting with it but went with a cliché shot instead (sort of a ''learn the rules before you break them'' lesson for me...). Anyway, that''s what I like about this - that and its strong first impression.  It''s a little bottom-heavy for my tastes and deeper dof would have satisfied my detail fix but I like the lighting you employed here. << 9 >>', '2007-02-15 23:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
