(3371814, 467095, 44611, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done, I love the depth of field and the clarity of the glass.  But, as I''m sure I won''t be the only one to comment, although I appreciate it''s a fruit juice or wine, that is a product of a fruit rather than a fruit itself.</td>', 'Beautifully done, I love the depth of field and the clarity of the glass.  But, as I''m sure I won''t be the only one to comment, although I appreciate it''s a fruit juice or wine, that is a product of a fruit rather than a fruit itself.', '2007-02-16 04:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
