(3373216, 466224, 31606, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.   Two things that bother me.  It is a mighty tight crop on those Fruits.  Maybe leave 1/2" on the right side.  Also I think this would be much better if you had a slower shutter to make the water blurry.  It would have a much better mood IMO.</td>', 'Nice colors.   Two things that bother me.  It is a mighty tight crop on those Fruits.  Maybe leave 1/2" on the right side.  Also I think this would be much better if you had a slower shutter to make the water blurry.  It would have a much better mood IMO.', '2007-02-16 16:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3373287, 466677, 66597, '<td valign="top">Very creative. You really went to some effort for those extra touches! I think a fill flash would have helped bring out the banana a little more, though.</td>', 'Very creative. You really went to some effort for those extra touches! I think a fill flash would have helped bring out the banana a little more, though.', '2007-02-16 17:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
