(3374065, 467382, 13688, '<td valign="top">i admire your fearlessness with the tight crop, heavy shadowing, and b/w conversion.  i only wish i could figure out who ormson was and why his fruit is so special.</td>', 'i admire your fearlessness with the tight crop, heavy shadowing, and b/w conversion.  i only wish i could figure out who ormson was and why his fruit is so special.', '2007-02-16 22:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374072, 466355, 13688, '<td valign="top">iteresting choice with the skewed horizon line.  gives the image a feeling of impulse...you don''t get that with many still lifes.</td>', 'iteresting choice with the skewed horizon line.  gives the image a feeling of impulse...you don''t get that with many still lifes.', '2007-02-16 22:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374076, 465190, 13688, '<td valign="top">i liked this more, before i found out they were grapes.  it reminded me of a dragonfly.  nice idea for the lighting.  would have liked to see the stem cleaned up a bit</td>', 'i liked this more, before i found out they were grapes.  it reminded me of a dragonfly.  nice idea for the lighting.  would have liked to see the stem cleaned up a bit', '2007-02-16 22:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374079, 464514, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice lighting.  tough to compete with jmseltzer''s interpretation.</td>', 'nice lighting.  tough to compete with jmseltzer''s interpretation.', '2007-02-16 22:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374080, 467038, 13688, '<td valign="top">i think this could have been more interesting...though not sure if possible with your macro capabilities...to just have the kiwi with the coconut background...it wouldn''t be so busy as your current composition</td>', 'i think this could have been more interesting...though not sure if possible with your macro capabilities...to just have the kiwi with the coconut background...it wouldn''t be so busy as your current composition', '2007-02-16 22:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374083, 466576, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Nice composition, colors and concept, however it is too blurry to decipher the focal point, and even the bokeh - which looks like good potential.  Looks like you took it ''in situ'' - perhaps a tripod or something may have helped and/or no wind (if apt).</td>', '3 - Nice composition, colors and concept, however it is too blurry to decipher the focal point, and even the bokeh - which looks like good potential.  Looks like you took it ''in situ'' - perhaps a tripod or something may have helped and/or no wind (if apt).', '2007-02-16 22:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374088, 467397, 13688, '<td valign="top">to me the figure seems more concerned with the bright light shining in their face than the weight of the fruit.  then again, i also see a barking poodle with a bow on it''s head in the atlantic...so what do i know.  the light behind adds to the scene.</td>', 'to me the figure seems more concerned with the bright light shining in their face than the weight of the fruit.  then again, i also see a barking poodle with a bow on it''s head in the atlantic...so what do i know.  the light behind adds to the scene.', '2007-02-16 23:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374093, 466893, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice colors.  i''m left wanting to see this from an alternate angle.</td>', 'nice colors.  i''m left wanting to see this from an alternate angle.', '2007-02-16 23:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374113, 467433, 13688, '<td valign="top">as a parody this is fantastic.  if you were really looking for "refreshment", i''d work on your white balance.  actually if the background was pure white and the kiwi was green and a bit more in focus, and you cloned out the extraneous air bubble you''d be in business on this site.</td>', 'as a parody this is fantastic.  if you were really looking for "refreshment", i''d work on your white balance.  actually if the background was pure white and the kiwi was green and a bit more in focus, and you cloned out the extraneous air bubble you''d be in business on this site.', '2007-02-16 23:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374121, 466870, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice focus and lighting...the husk edge seems to break the interesting patterning the corn had going.  perhaps the fly was just dining and not posing.</td>', 'nice focus and lighting...the husk edge seems to break the interesting patterning the corn had going.  perhaps the fly was just dining and not posing.', '2007-02-16 23:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374124, 465190, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Very nice.  Very original.  Nice colors.  Like the background too.  Framing fits well.</td>', '9 - Very nice.  Very original.  Nice colors.  Like the background too.  Framing fits well.', '2007-02-16 23:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3374134, 467407, 13688, '<td valign="top">i feel the apple''s concern, which i would think isn''t easy to acheive.  but as you needed to zoom in to acheive this, i feel the composition suffers because for me the form is incomplete without the full knife.</td>', 'i feel the apple''s concern, which i would think isn''t easy to acheive.  but as you needed to zoom in to acheive this, i feel the composition suffers because for me the form is incomplete without the full knife.', '2007-02-16 23:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
