(3374402, 466852, 70828, '<td valign="top">I took a shot exactly like this ... only I set them on fire with BBQ lighter fluid ... I was gonna call it Hot Love too! ... But it did not turn out worth a pinch of poop ... so I did something else. The lighting, saturation and cleanliness of this image is GREAT! It looks very professional ... Congratulations on a job well done.</td>', 'I took a shot exactly like this ... only I set them on fire with BBQ lighter fluid ... I was gonna call it Hot Love too! ... But it did not turn out worth a pinch of poop ... so I did something else. The lighting, saturation and cleanliness of this image is GREAT! It looks very professional ... Congratulations on a job well done.', '2007-02-17 01:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
