(3375416, 467164, 67237, '<td valign="top">creative idea, but a little too isolated for my taste. I think that black background enhances the focus of this composition but it detracts realism.Other than the coins (which I like a lot) the rest seems to be floating because of the deep black. (7)</td>', 'creative idea, but a little too isolated for my taste. I think that black background enhances the focus of this composition but it detracts realism.Other than the coins (which I like a lot) the rest seems to be floating because of the deep black. (7)', '2007-02-17 13:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3375418, 467362, 67237, '<td valign="top">A bit over-exposed for my taste</td>', 'A bit over-exposed for my taste', '2007-02-17 13:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3375422, 467168, 67237, '<td valign="top">lemon lacks of focus.<br/>IMO deep black background for both vertical and horizontal planes does notwork because it makes things look as they were floating.</td>', 'lemon lacks of focus.IMO deep black background for both vertical and horizontal planes does notwork because it makes things look as they were floating.', '2007-02-17 14:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
