(3375561, 467402, 73230, '<td valign="top">There looks to be an effect in play here: If you look closely at the green stems and around some of the highlight there appears to be a lot of cross hatching. I am pretty sure it does not meet the challenge rules.<br/> <br/>The image itself is good, i like the title and composition although i think the framing could have been improved slightly.</td>', 'There looks to be an effect in play here: If you look closely at the green stems and around some of the highlight there appears to be a lot of cross hatching. I am pretty sure it does not meet the challenge rules. The image itself is good, i like the title and composition although i think the framing could have been improved slightly.', '2007-02-17 15:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3375582, 466929, 73230, '<td valign="top">Lighting could be improved, colour a little washed, framing good have been a little better. Bettr luck next time.</td>', 'Lighting could be improved, colour a little washed, framing good have been a little better. Bettr luck next time.', '2007-02-17 15:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
