(3375628, 466482, 73230, '<td valign="top">Maybe its just me, but i am confused by the title. I dont see the relevance of the veg on the head ??<br/> <br/>Technically, the lighting could have been a little stronger, pose slightly more exciting, PP to bring out the colour more. Good effort though.</td>', 'Maybe its just me, but i am confused by the title. I dont see the relevance of the veg on the head ?? Technically, the lighting could have been a little stronger, pose slightly more exciting, PP to bring out the colour more. Good effort though.', '2007-02-17 15:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3375632, 467041, 73230, '<td valign="top">Not a very exciting shot, needs some PP to neutralise the colour and adjustment of the levels to give a little more punch.</td>', 'Not a very exciting shot, needs some PP to neutralise the colour and adjustment of the levels to give a little more punch.', '2007-02-17 15:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3375636, 466759, 73230, '<td valign="top">A little more effort with this image would have been nice. The shot is too straight on and the veg could have been organsised a little better. <br/> <br/>Lighting not very good and would have worked better if it was wrapped around the jar softer.</td>', 'A little more effort with this image would have been nice. The shot is too straight on and the veg could have been organsised a little better.  Lighting not very good and would have worked better if it was wrapped around the jar softer.', '2007-02-17 15:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3375641, 464587, 73230, '<td valign="top">I think you have over prosessed this image. Those lines one the outside of the apples are distracting. The croping could have been better. This had the potential to be a very good photograph. Better luck next time.</td>', 'I think you have over prosessed this image. Those lines one the outside of the apples are distracting. The croping could have been better. This had the potential to be a very good photograph. Better luck next time.', '2007-02-17 15:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3375646, 467257, 73230, '<td valign="top">Really not very exciting, Too blurry.</td>', 'Really not very exciting, Too blurry.', '2007-02-17 15:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3375648, 467135, 73230, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I would like to have seen it with not as many bubbles, i am finding the a little distractin, but overall well done.</td>', 'Nice image. I would like to have seen it with not as many bubbles, i am finding the a little distractin, but overall well done.', '2007-02-17 15:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3375679, 467436, 73230, '<td valign="top">Nice image however i feel there is some detail missing fromt he cherries.</td>', 'Nice image however i feel there is some detail missing fromt he cherries.', '2007-02-17 15:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
