(3375740, 465517, 60770, '<td valign="top">Did you try framing so the apple is slightly lower and larger? I love the shot, but the compositions seems a little uneasy</td>', 'Did you try framing so the apple is slightly lower and larger? I love the shot, but the compositions seems a little uneasy', '2007-02-17 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3375746, 467110, 74273, '<td valign="top">The contrast of the ripe fruit (a product of a live tree) and this old, dry wood (from a dead tree) is really interesting.</td>', 'The contrast of the ripe fruit (a product of a live tree) and this old, dry wood (from a dead tree) is really interesting.', '2007-02-17 16:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3375755, 465801, 74273, '<td valign="top">Great alternative view of a farmer''s market. Great pattern, texture, and color.</td>', 'Great alternative view of a farmer''s market. Great pattern, texture, and color.', '2007-02-17 16:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3375758, 467067, 74273, '<td valign="top">Great texture!</td>', 'Great texture!', '2007-02-17 16:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3376051, 467113, 2158, '<td valign="top">Great work.  Looks too good to eat!</td>', 'Great work.  Looks too good to eat!', '2007-02-17 18:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3376062, 465542, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I just wish there was a bit more detail in the socks.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I just wish there was a bit more detail in the socks.', '2007-02-17 18:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3376158, 467348, 66524, '<td valign="top">very, very nice - your concept, the splash, the peppers, I especially like the DOF from the fingers (the peppers are an obvious focus)to the forearm.  Also interesting are that the splashes, they are sized according to where I ought to be looking, then , like "connect the dots" it takes me through the rest of the photo.  You must have had the water pressure "just right".  It''s a moment frozen in time.  It''s just delicious to look at.  Whatever did you make with those after cleaning?</td>', 'very, very nice - your concept, the splash, the peppers, I especially like the DOF from the fingers (the peppers are an obvious focus)to the forearm.  Also interesting are that the splashes, they are sized according to where I ought to be looking, then , like "connect the dots" it takes me through the rest of the photo.  You must have had the water pressure "just right".  It''s a moment frozen in time.  It''s just delicious to look at.  Whatever did you make with those after cleaning?', '2007-02-17 20:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3376163, 467381, 66524, '<td valign="top">First, It''s very clever! Second, the title reads to me as Boo (as in you scared me)...adding more O''s would make it a crowd reaction -...BOOOOOO - JMHO.  Still I like the shot.</td>', 'First, It''s very clever! Second, the title reads to me as Boo (as in you scared me)...adding more O''s would make it a crowd reaction -...BOOOOOO - JMHO.  Still I like the shot.', '2007-02-17 20:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3376177, 466489, 66524, '<td valign="top">I like the black &amp; white with the color section, but it lacks focus given the distance.  The lighting is harsh &amp; glaring, but still a nice concept.</td>', 'I like the black & white with the color section, but it lacks focus given the distance.  The lighting is harsh & glaring, but still a nice concept.', '2007-02-17 20:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3376179, 467037, 66524, '<td valign="top">Very clever: image and title.  I wish the carrot wasn''t so dry.</td>', 'Very clever: image and title.  I wish the carrot wasn''t so dry.', '2007-02-17 20:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3376194, 467397, 66524, '<td valign="top">Great photo - but just for fun, if the wooden man was pushing the orange up hill and titled "The Nightmare of Sisyphus" it would be perfect! IMHO.  But then how mant DPCers know greek mythology.</td>', 'Great photo - but just for fun, if the wooden man was pushing the orange up hill and titled "The Nightmare of Sisyphus" it would be perfect! IMHO.  But then how mant DPCers know greek mythology.', '2007-02-17 20:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3376208, 467434, 66524, '<td valign="top">WOW! there''s a lot to look at, but I find no rhythm in the photo to establish a solid composition.  I look at each vegetable, not the whole photo.  Also to note, the photo seems too washed out in the color, almost too yellow (tomatoes, carrots &amp; red pepper especially).</td>', 'WOW! there''s a lot to look at, but I find no rhythm in the photo to establish a solid composition.  I look at each vegetable, not the whole photo.  Also to note, the photo seems too washed out in the color, almost too yellow (tomatoes, carrots & red pepper especially).', '2007-02-17 20:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3376216, 467266, 66524, '<td valign="top">As the photo was loading, I thought it would be an onion.  IMHO B&amp;W and irregular shape of the "apple" adds little to the photo.</td>', 'As the photo was loading, I thought it would be an onion.  IMHO B&W and irregular shape of the "apple" adds little to the photo.', '2007-02-17 20:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3376225, 465801, 66524, '<td valign="top">The baskets of fruit are very appealing and I like the point of view, but the other stuff is distracting: yellow basket, the bag in upper left and whatever the other thing is next to it, plus, the figure who has been foreshortened due to angle.</td>', 'The baskets of fruit are very appealing and I like the point of view, but the other stuff is distracting: yellow basket, the bag in upper left and whatever the other thing is next to it, plus, the figure who has been foreshortened due to angle.', '2007-02-17 20:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3376244, 467438, 73032, '<td valign="top">I love the colors, and the up close detail.</td>', 'I love the colors, and the up close detail.', '2007-02-17 21:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3376254, 466158, 73032, '<td valign="top">nice up close detail.</td>', 'nice up close detail.', '2007-02-17 21:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3376256, 467058, 73032, '<td valign="top">crisp!</td>', 'crisp!', '2007-02-17 21:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3376281, 464308, 66524, '<td valign="top">JMHO...I am offering a comment because "team work makes the dream work"<br/> <br/>The Color is off as well as too grainy.  There is no real compostion and the bottom crop was not done well.  The "spectators" don''t "read" like a crowd or fans of the game, but rather just placed to satisfy what was probably a good idea.  Keep at it though.  I am too new to offer advice to improve(not at my figer tips} but I have learned about Jpeg and the right time to save.  Look for a tutorials or post the photo in a thread once judging is over.<br/>Forge on!</td>', 'JMHO...I am offering a comment because "team work makes the dream work" The Color is off as well as too grainy.  There is no real compostion and the bottom crop was not done well.  The "spectators" don''t "read" like a crowd or fans of the game, but rather just placed to satisfy what was probably a good idea.  Keep at it though.  I am too new to offer advice to improve(not at my figer tips} but I have learned about Jpeg and the right time to save.  Look for a tutorials or post the photo in a thread once judging is over.Forge on!', '2007-02-17 21:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3376307, 464331, 66524, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract, but why B&amp;W?  I would imagine the color would have made the photo pop!  What works for me is the division of the florets - maybe more of that would have pushed me to a higher vote.  Also confusing are the white specs, not the blooms of the veggie, but the little specs as though a misting of water? - it doesn''t "read" as mist.  I admire the courage to enter "out of the box" concepts.</td>', 'Nice abstract, but why B&W?  I would imagine the color would have made the photo pop!  What works for me is the division of the florets - maybe more of that would have pushed me to a higher vote.  Also confusing are the white specs, not the blooms of the veggie, but the little specs as though a misting of water? - it doesn''t "read" as mist.  I admire the courage to enter "out of the box" concepts.', '2007-02-17 21:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3376318, 467369, 50695, '<td valign="top">brilliant. you are a god among gourds. 10</td>', 'brilliant. you are a god among gourds. 10', '2007-02-17 21:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3376319, 464308, 50695, '<td valign="top">Black: b to f3. 10 to stop brown.</td>', 'Black: b to f3. 10 to stop brown.', '2007-02-17 21:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3376325, 465801, 50695, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge. wow, love it, wow. one senses the realism of economic struggle but at the same time is transported to a fantasy land, perhaps one emanating from the child''s dream. 10 10 10</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge. wow, love it, wow. one senses the realism of economic struggle but at the same time is transported to a fantasy land, perhaps one emanating from the child''s dream. 10 10 10', '2007-02-17 21:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3376327, 467338, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is so tactile. wow. 9</td>', 'this is so tactile. wow. 9', '2007-02-17 21:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
