(3377750, 466355, 69008, '<td valign="top">Cropped a bit tight for my taste, and a bit out of level. Like the colors and light. It seems that there could be a little more done with the bowl refractions in order to make that a bigger part of the subject of the image. I am not sure how to get the extra light there, but know that it can be done.</td>', 'Cropped a bit tight for my taste, and a bit out of level. Like the colors and light. It seems that there could be a little more done with the bowl refractions in order to make that a bigger part of the subject of the image. I am not sure how to get the extra light there, but know that it can be done.', '2007-02-18 12:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
