(3378469, 465801, 69008, '<td valign="top">The hot colors on the edges of the containers really set this out front. The whole scene, and the direct overhead angle are first class camera handling skill. PP is excellent to get the desired powerful effect of the colors.</td>', 'The hot colors on the edges of the containers really set this out front. The whole scene, and the direct overhead angle are first class camera handling skill. PP is excellent to get the desired powerful effect of the colors.', '2007-02-18 17:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3378472, 466277, 72167, '<td valign="top">does look like a planet!!<br/>:-)</td>', 'does look like a planet!!:-)', '2007-02-18 17:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3378474, 466513, 72167, '<td valign="top">hmm.... a little dark. Too abstract for me perhaps....</td>', 'hmm.... a little dark. Too abstract for me perhaps....', '2007-02-18 17:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3378475, 467390, 72167, '<td valign="top">cute</td>', 'cute', '2007-02-18 17:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3378492, 465786, 22748, '<td valign="top">Sorry, that masking job is really not good. Perhaps you need to increase the brightness of your monitor to see the problem.</td>', 'Sorry, that masking job is really not good. Perhaps you need to increase the brightness of your monitor to see the problem.', '2007-02-18 17:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3378554, 467391, 69102, '<td valign="top">As an image: the focus seems off a bit as the radishes and much of the stem areas appear a little out of focus; the watermelon also get''s lost in the background and therefore loses its explicit shape, therefore undermining the metaphor. As to the metaphoric entendre: just sort of tacky.</td>', 'As an image: the focus seems off a bit as the radishes and much of the stem areas appear a little out of focus; the watermelon also get''s lost in the background and therefore loses its explicit shape, therefore undermining the metaphor. As to the metaphoric entendre: just sort of tacky.', '2007-02-18 18:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
