(3379598, 467273, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your new high score!  Just ignore lecter.  Still life is still life, and this is a beautifully colorful example.<br/> <br/>To increase the score by a bit, there are a few small things you could do: don''t crop quite so tightly, really nail the focus, maybe brighten it a bit, and make your background pure black.  Oh, and I suppose misting some water onto the fruit wouldn''t hurt - that seems to bump scores at DPC.<br/> <br/>But those are all small things.</td>', 'Congrats on your new high score!  Just ignore lecter.  Still life is still life, and this is a beautifully colorful example. To increase the score by a bit, there are a few small things you could do: don''t crop quite so tightly, really nail the focus, maybe brighten it a bit, and make your background pure black.  Oh, and I suppose misting some water onto the fruit wouldn''t hurt - that seems to bump scores at DPC. But those are all small things.', '2007-02-19 00:19:35.000000', NULL, 0),
