(3379780, 467273, 66384, '<td valign="top">Congratulation on your new personal best. You deserved it with this shot. <br/> <br/>Some people said you should make the background blacker. I happen to like the folds in the fabric. Maybe the problem is it is in between. It''s a little too dark to see the fabric, and a little to light to be a pure black. I''d go for lighter, because you seem to have taken some care to arrange the fabric, and I think that would be more interesting than the stock shot you''d get with pure black.</td>', 'Congratulation on your new personal best. You deserved it with this shot.  Some people said you should make the background blacker. I happen to like the folds in the fabric. Maybe the problem is it is in between. It''s a little too dark to see the fabric, and a little to light to be a pure black. I''d go for lighter, because you seem to have taken some care to arrange the fabric, and I think that would be more interesting than the stock shot you''d get with pure black.', '2007-02-19 00:51:19.000000', NULL, 0),
