(3380509, 464331, 52992, '<td valign="top">Love the texture, but the gray really doesn''t work for me.  I''d like to see this in green instead.</td>', 'Love the texture, but the gray really doesn''t work for me.  I''d like to see this in green instead.', '2007-02-19 07:39:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3380510, 465839, 2490, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  I know the challenges of it, believe me, and you kicked my butt by several notches of technical excellence and half a point.  Congrats.  <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=466757" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/632/thumb/466757.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/632/thumb/466757.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/632/thumb/466757.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Good shot.  I know the challenges of it, believe me, and you kicked my butt by several notches of technical excellence and half a point.  Congrats.   ', '2007-02-19 07:40:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3380511, 467034, 23484, '<td valign="top">Kelli, this is really nice. You have great lighting on the texture of the fruit but I think what hurt was the lack of sharpness.</td>', 'Kelli, this is really nice. You have great lighting on the texture of the fruit but I think what hurt was the lack of sharpness.', '2007-02-19 07:40:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3380513, 466765, 66597, '<td valign="top">Yay!!! Congrats on your new PB! I love the bright color combo of the asparagus and tomatoes, and very nice composition.</td>', 'Yay!!! Congrats on your new PB! I love the bright color combo of the asparagus and tomatoes, and very nice composition.', '2007-02-19 07:40:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3380514, 467254, 52992, '<td valign="top">I like this - the colour is wonderful.</td>', 'I like this - the colour is wonderful.', '2007-02-19 07:41:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3380515, 466765, 52992, '<td valign="top">Great colours in this.<br/> <br/>Congrats on a new personal best !</td>', 'Great colours in this. Congrats on a new personal best !', '2007-02-19 07:42:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3380516, 466396, 23484, '<td valign="top">WOW, you got screwed. This is what my original idea was going to be.  The sharpness is great  and the contrasting background really makes it stand out.  I gave this a 7.</td>', 'WOW, you got screwed. This is what my original idea was going to be.  The sharpness is great  and the contrasting background really makes it stand out.  I gave this a 7.', '2007-02-19 07:42:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3380519, 467454, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast in color between the red and green.</td>', 'Nice contrast in color between the red and green.', '2007-02-19 07:42:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3380520, 465755, 66597, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a very good entry, and although it''s a solid score, I expected it would finish much higher. I think you did a fantastic job with the lighting, colors and composition. Very well done all around!</td>', 'I thought this was a very good entry, and although it''s a solid score, I expected it would finish much higher. I think you did a fantastic job with the lighting, colors and composition. Very well done all around!', '2007-02-19 07:43:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3380521, 466760, 52992, '<td valign="top">I have to admit - I''m glad I don''t shop there.  <br/> <br/>Great capture - good colours and focus.</td>', 'I have to admit - I''m glad I don''t shop there.   Great capture - good colours and focus.', '2007-02-19 07:43:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3380522, 467454, 52992, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and contrast.</td>', 'Great lighting and contrast.', '2007-02-19 07:44:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3380524, 467254, 23484, '<td valign="top">You are starting to rival Raish for the OOB shots.  Maybe he''s the king and you''re the queen.  The face is great in this shot.  I like the nice dark contrasting background. I really thought this should have scored better.</td>', 'You are starting to rival Raish for the OOB shots.  Maybe he''s the king and you''re the queen.  The face is great in this shot.  I like the nice dark contrasting background. I really thought this should have scored better.', '2007-02-19 07:44:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3380525, 467271, 2490, '<td valign="top">Good job, babe.  You kicked my butt by a whole tenth of a point and 21 places :)  Just shows what we know!</td>', 'Good job, babe.  You kicked my butt by a whole tenth of a point and 21 places :)  Just shows what we know!', '2007-02-19 07:46:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3380528, 467111, 66597, '<td valign="top">Don, you are always counted upon to be original. Although I admit I''m not wild about part of the foreground (lighting is too harsh IMO), I think the background is brilliant.</td>', 'Don, you are always counted upon to be original. Although I admit I''m not wild about part of the foreground (lighting is too harsh IMO), I think the background is brilliant.', '2007-02-19 07:49:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3380529, 467456, 66597, '<td valign="top">Jeffrey, when voting I found this to be a solid entry, though maybe not inspired. I do think it has a humorous appeal, especially with the banana ears, but the overhead lighting is pretty harsh. Kudos for the diagonal composition, adds a creative touch.<br/>edited for my lousy grammar :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-19 11:40:14.</i></td>', 'Jeffrey, when voting I found this to be a solid entry, though maybe not inspired. I do think it has a humorous appeal, especially with the banana ears, but the overhead lighting is pretty harsh. Kudos for the diagonal composition, adds a creative touch.edited for my lousy grammar :-)', '2007-02-19 07:52:41.000000', '2007-02-19 11:40:14.000000', 0),
(3380531, 467442, 60770, '<td valign="top">Whoever gave this a 1 is just bitter!</td>', 'Whoever gave this a 1 is just bitter!', '2007-02-19 07:54:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3380532, 466438, 66597, '<td valign="top">Susan, I love the lighting here, really good idea. I think you got hurt because the oranges aren''t quite in focus, and DPC is very unforgiving in that area in general. Not sure if you used a tripod, but if not, almost impossible to get sharp focus handheld at 1/4.</td>', 'Susan, I love the lighting here, really good idea. I think you got hurt because the oranges aren''t quite in focus, and DPC is very unforgiving in that area in general. Not sure if you used a tripod, but if not, almost impossible to get sharp focus handheld at 1/4.', '2007-02-19 07:54:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3380536, 466480, 66597, '<td valign="top">Excellent personification with this entry. Title suits these peppers excellently. Nice, crisp details and very strong composition for simple subject. As usual, great entry Deb!</td>', 'Excellent personification with this entry. Title suits these peppers excellently. Nice, crisp details and very strong composition for simple subject. As usual, great entry Deb!', '2007-02-19 07:57:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3380538, 467034, 66597, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. I gave it a 7, and am surprised you didn''t score higher. The texture and backlighting is great. I suspect Bob is right that the voters wanted just a little more sharpness, but I still think you got robbed!</td>', 'I love this shot. I gave it a 7, and am surprised you didn''t score higher. The texture and backlighting is great. I suspect Bob is right that the voters wanted just a little more sharpness, but I still think you got robbed!', '2007-02-19 07:58:38.000000', NULL, 0),
