(3381402, 466908, 66384, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by xianart:</b></div><hr/><i> hmm, well.  yup, it''s a snapshot.  here''s one treatment of it:<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=471664" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/53572/thumb/471664.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/53572/thumb/471664.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/53572/thumb/471664.jpg"/></a> i dunno if it''s better, but it''s different. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yup, different, but still terrible. The shot is hopeless.</td>', 'Originally posted by xianart: hmm, well.  yup, it''s a snapshot.  here''s one treatment of it: i dunno if it''s better, but it''s different.  Yup, different, but still terrible. The shot is hopeless.', '2007-02-19 12:16:25.000000', NULL, 0),
