(3381488, 465839, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Love your notes.  This kind of shot doesn''t do all that much for me but you did it extremely well and the information about the lighting setup is very valuable!  (Not that I have any flashes to use, but it''s good to know.)  I''d actually like to see an outtake where the orange missed the vase.  :-)</td>', 'LOL!  Love your notes.  This kind of shot doesn''t do all that much for me but you did it extremely well and the information about the lighting setup is very valuable!  (Not that I have any flashes to use, but it''s good to know.)  I''d actually like to see an outtake where the orange missed the vase.  :-)', '2007-02-19 12:48:08.000000', NULL, 0),
