(3382895, 467254, 11854, '<td valign="top">I really loved the face in this one, especially the mouth! I gave this a 7 in voting. It would have been higher except for it being so dark. Though that might have been what you were going for. I really expected this to place higher.</td>', 'I really loved the face in this one, especially the mouth! I gave this a 7 in voting. It would have been higher except for it being so dark. Though that might have been what you were going for. I really expected this to place higher.', '2007-02-19 19:54:44.000000', NULL, 0),
