(3382913, 464331, 11854, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 5 in voting. If it had been in color it would have been much higher. Knowing that it was a vegetable, yet having that grayish, blackish coloring made it very unappetising.</td>', 'I gave this a 5 in voting. If it had been in color it would have been much higher. Knowing that it was a vegetable, yet having that grayish, blackish coloring made it very unappetising.', '2007-02-19 20:01:13.000000', NULL, 0),
