(3383246, 465755, 66384, '<td valign="top">LOL. That''s the way I like my fruit too! Nice lighting. The crop seems a little tight.</td>', 'LOL. That''s the way I like my fruit too! Nice lighting. The crop seems a little tight.', '2007-02-19 21:28:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3383423, 467442, 19672, '<td valign="top">Nice job, congrats on another ribbon...<br/> <br/>:)<br/> <br/>Bananas Rock!</td>', 'Nice job, congrats on another ribbon... :) Bananas Rock!', '2007-02-19 22:34:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3383457, 467111, 41802, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>Wow I guess voters really did pick up on the mushroom not being a vegetable.  I really didn''t even think about that when I was voting.  But based on the comments I wonder if people really didn''t vote as high because of this. <br/> <br/>"Gazing upon our own reflection" is a good entry into the Fruit and Vegetable Challenge, heck all the mushrooms I buy are in the produce department. I really think your lighting allows this image to stand out.  The lighting really gives us more depth to the focal point.  I also really like the placement of the focus, not a typical shot, very nice.  I think your choice for the background is awesome because it really is something different.  I am not sure if you used the screen for lighting purposes but it really adds a nice feature to the shot.  <br/> <br/>Overall I think this is a very strong shot, maybe the score would have been a little higher is the challenge was something like The Produce Section, or Mushrooms. Very nice work as usual. <br/></td>', '*Critique Club* Wow I guess voters really did pick up on the mushroom not being a vegetable.  I really didn''t even think about that when I was voting.  But based on the comments I wonder if people really didn''t vote as high because of this.  "Gazing upon our own reflection" is a good entry into the Fruit and Vegetable Challenge, heck all the mushrooms I buy are in the produce department. I really think your lighting allows this image to stand out.  The lighting really gives us more depth to the focal point.  I also really like the placement of the focus, not a typical shot, very nice.  I think your choice for the background is awesome because it really is something different.  I am not sure if you used the screen for lighting purposes but it really adds a nice feature to the shot.   Overall I think this is a very strong shot, maybe the score would have been a little higher is the challenge was something like The Produce Section, or Mushrooms. Very nice work as usual. ', '2007-02-19 22:47:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3383618, 467442, 17203, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kosmikkreeper:</b></div><hr/><i>...it must take time to come up with such unique concepts!</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It certainly does! I thought of the basic idea while brainstorming for the Yellow III challenge last April, but decided it would be too hard. I went back to it when this challenge was announced and spent much of the week figuring out how to make it happen.</td>', 'Originally posted by kosmikkreeper:...it must take time to come up with such unique concepts!  It certainly does! I thought of the basic idea while brainstorming for the Yellow III challenge last April, but decided it would be too hard. I went back to it when this challenge was announced and spent much of the week figuring out how to make it happen.', '2007-02-19 23:52:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3383658, 465190, 53814, '<td valign="top">perfect</td>', 'perfect', '2007-02-20 00:06:59.000000', NULL, 0),
