(3404307, 466532, 45524, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique club. First let me say that I enjoyed looking at this entry. Its a very well focused and creative shot. You have good lighting. I would like to see a bit more light on the one side of the pepper. Creative use of negative space, I wish there werent quite so much of it though. That may be a personal preference. Being advanced editing I might also have cloned out the stray flame at the top it takes a bit of focus off the main subject. Overall very creative and well done, fits the challenge well. My vote would have been a 7 had I voted.</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique club. First let me say that I enjoyed looking at this entry. Its a very well focused and creative shot. You have good lighting. I would like to see a bit more light on the one side of the pepper. Creative use of negative space, I wish there werent quite so much of it though. That may be a personal preference. Being advanced editing I might also have cloned out the stray flame at the top it takes a bit of focus off the main subject. Overall very creative and well done, fits the challenge well. My vote would have been a 7 had I voted.', '2007-02-25 22:20:31.000000', NULL, 0),
