(3414847, 465886, 62187, '<td valign="top">Well, I''m not a huge fan but this shot caught my eye and I was suprised to find that somebody thought it might have been mine. I must say, I really like it - the ''subject'' and timing are perfect! I am wondering, not that it''s a bad photo by any means, but why didn''t you take advantage of the advanced editing? I wonder how much better it could have been? Hope all is well and take care...Brad</td>', 'Well, I''m not a huge fan but this shot caught my eye and I was suprised to find that somebody thought it might have been mine. I must say, I really like it - the ''subject'' and timing are perfect! I am wondering, not that it''s a bad photo by any means, but why didn''t you take advantage of the advanced editing? I wonder how much better it could have been? Hope all is well and take care...Brad', '2007-02-28 17:43:42.000000', NULL, 0),
