(3422234, 466616, 63360, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jgrieco:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by girlwithpistol:</b></div><hr/><i> I think if the colours were burnt a little more and there wasn''t so much noise, this would make an even more amazing photo.  I like the idea and colours used, though.  :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the comment.  Correcting noise sounds like an easy technical fix but I''m not familiar with details.   Any suggestions what to look for and how to correct? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You can download a trial version of neat image to reduce noise.  This free version works for small files.  (I don''t really see much noise in your photo, which by the way, I really like.  The colors look spectacular!)</td>', 'Originally posted by jgrieco: Originally posted by girlwithpistol: I think if the colours were burnt a little more and there wasn''t so much noise, this would make an even more amazing photo.  I like the idea and colours used, though.  :)   Thanks for the comment.  Correcting noise sounds like an easy technical fix but I''m not familiar with details.   Any suggestions what to look for and how to correct?   You can download a trial version of neat image to reduce noise.  This free version works for small files.  (I don''t really see much noise in your photo, which by the way, I really like.  The colors look spectacular!)', '2007-03-02 08:21:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3422699, 466564, 61138, '<td valign="top">I like the low DOF, but it feels like it could use just a little more light. Maybe a fill to cut down on some hard shadow.<br/> <br/>The subject matter is interesting. I wish you''d cropped in the top of the onion.</td>', 'I like the low DOF, but it feels like it could use just a little more light. Maybe a fill to cut down on some hard shadow. The subject matter is interesting. I wish you''d cropped in the top of the onion.', '2007-03-02 11:49:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3423857, 466564, 43565, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 5.  I like the subject and the DOF is fine.  The lighting on the mushroom and onion is good, the other white veg could use a little more detail.  I think it would be improved by moving it all off center and not cropping so close to the top of the onion.</td>', 'I gave this a 5.  I like the subject and the DOF is fine.  The lighting on the mushroom and onion is good, the other white veg could use a little more detail.  I think it would be improved by moving it all off center and not cropping so close to the top of the onion.', '2007-03-02 18:02:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3423860, 466564, 42013, '<td valign="top">Count me as one that would like either more DOF or less objects in the picture. Your detail on the shroom is good and you might play around with some tighter cropping.</td>', 'Count me as one that would like either more DOF or less objects in the picture. Your detail on the shroom is good and you might play around with some tighter cropping.', '2007-03-02 18:03:02.000000', NULL, 0),
