(3427317, 466368, 60614, '<td valign="top">Great concept.  I love the warm tones.  The oranges seem a bit blown out and they look like the need to be sharper.  Maybe try running USM on them.  There are a few specks on the flat surface that are a bit distracting. I get dinged for this everytime.  Try not centering the subject so much and play around with arranging your oranges in different areas.</td>', 'Great concept.  I love the warm tones.  The oranges seem a bit blown out and they look like the need to be sharper.  Maybe try running USM on them.  There are a few specks on the flat surface that are a bit distracting. I get dinged for this everytime.  Try not centering the subject so much and play around with arranging your oranges in different areas.', '2007-03-04 08:24:06.000000', NULL, 0),
